fvue-ui — unofficial Vue 3 port of @fanvue/ui (Apache-2.0).

This product includes software developed by Fanvue (Shift Holdings Ltd),
original library @fanvue/ui, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Source: https://github.com/fanvue/fanv-ui
Changes vs original: framework port from React to Vue 3 (SFC, v-model, slots,
Reka UI primitives instead of Radix UI). Token stylesheet is re-exported
from the original package, not vendored.

